title    Arcade palette: drums
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Each new drum alone for two bars: bigkick, gatesnare, hat909, ohat909, clap909.
tempo    120
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.2

voice bigkick   bigkick   vol=0.85
voice gatesnare gatesnare vol=0.8
voice hat909    hat909    vol=0.8
voice ohat909   ohat909   vol=0.8
voice clap909   clap909   vol=0.8

pattern kick
bigkick | x... x... x... x..x | x... .... X... .... |

pattern snare
gatesnare | .... x... .... x... | .... X... .... .... |

pattern hat
hat909 | x.x. x.x. xxxx x.x. | xoxo xoxo X... .... |

pattern ohat
ohat909 | ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x. | X... .... .... .... |

pattern clap
clap909 | .... x... .... x... | .... X... .... .... |

pattern rest
bigkick | _ |

play kick snare hat ohat clap
loop rest
